[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2640.309, "timestamp": "00:44:00", "text": "我知道，我一直觉得，就像我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2642.23, "timestamp": "00:44:02", "text": "一直想做这件事，但我太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2644.47, "timestamp": "00:44:04", "text": "紧张，但我很高兴关键在于我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2646.43, "timestamp": "00:44:06", "text": "现在就在这里。但我只想说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2650.23, "timestamp": "00:44:10", "text": "就像你之前说的，呃，合作之前就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2651.99, "timestamp": "00:44:11", "text": "我希望你的耳朵没事。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2652.022, "timestamp": "00:44:12", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hey pratham and vinzi"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2653.43, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "text": "因为就像你说的，你不能"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2653.685, "timestamp": "00:44:13", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! notpravin~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2655.99, "timestamp": "00:44:15", "text": "就像听尖锐的声音一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2657.91, "timestamp": "00:44:17", "text": "问题是我根本听不进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2660.79, "timestamp": "00:44:20", "text": "就像尖锐的声音本身一样。但是，你"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2661.674, "timestamp": "00:44:21", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sup pravin"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2662.55, "timestamp": "00:44:22", "text": "拥有最柔和的嗓音之一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2664.63, "timestamp": "00:44:24", "text": "我听过的最离谱的事。所以就像我刚才说的，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2666.79, "timestamp": "00:44:26", "text": "如果你的声音像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2668.55, "timestamp": "00:44:28", "text": "一把刀，就像那些塑料刀一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2670.95, "timestamp": "00:44:30", "text": "你知道的蛋糕刀，连黄油都不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2673.27, "timestamp": "00:44:33", "text": "刀，甚至不是那种像我一样的黄油刀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2677.67, "timestamp": "00:44:37", "text": "连这点钱都不会给你。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2680.23, "timestamp": "00:44:40", "text": "一切都好。一切都好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.87, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "我很欣赏你看着我的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2685.4, "timestamp": "00:44:45", "text": "向外张望。确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2687.109, "timestamp": "00:44:47", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.829, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "是的，我有点担心如果一切都……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2692.23, "timestamp": "00:44:52", "text": "没事的。我并不想喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2695.03, "timestamp": "00:44:55", "text": "对着麦克风大喊，就像我低下头一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2698.069, "timestamp": "00:44:58", "text": "灵敏度略有提高。"}]